  {
   "inputSource": "V Orange",
   "type": "post",
   "id": "4011505121853379614",
   "code": "DeruqeKuxQe",
   "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DeruqeKuxQe/",
   "createdAt": "2026-10-19T16:52:34.000Z",
   "likeCount": 2564,
   "commentCount": 58,
   "isAvailable": true,
   "caption": "TAYLOR SWIFT CELEBRITY POSING HACK 📸 Do you feel awkward posing for photos?\n\nIt’s really easy to end up holding a pose for a long time and looking stiff, especially because a lot of us hold tension in our face and our shoulders.\n\nThink about all of the times you’ve been stuck taking a bunch of photos and they just get progressively worse and worse because you become more tense.\n\nBy simply rocking her shoulders and adjusting the placement of her head in between snaps, Taylor keeps her pose from getting stiff and adds a subtle sense of movement to her photos. \n\nNot only does she look more relaxed, but it also gives the photographers a wider variety of photos to choose from!\n\nNext time you step in front of the camera, try these two tips…\n\n➡️ ONE: After you strike your pose, slowly rock your shoulders in a sprinkler motion.\n\n➡️ TWO: Adjust the placement of your head a little in between each snap.\n\nFOUND THIS HELPFUL? ✨ Comment “PHOTO” to get a copy of my free guide “Five Secrets for Better Photos.”\n\nSHARE this post with a friend and be sure to FOLLOW along for more tips! - Christine 💋\n\n-\n\n#taylorswift #celebrityposingtips #redcarpetposes #posingtips #howtopose\n\nHow to pose for photos. How to look natural in photos. How to look relaxed in photos. How to pose your face. How to pose your shoulders. Taylor Swift. Taylor Swift red carpet poses. How to pose like Taylor Swift.",
